#: kgv_view.cpp:720
msgid ""
"You might see some errors in the display or it may work.\n"
"The error messages below are from Ghostscript (\"gs\") and may help identify "
"or correct the problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Možda ćete vidjeti neke greške u prikazu a možda će i raditi.\n"
"Poruke grešaka prikazane ispod su od Ghostscript-a (\"gs\") i mogu "
"vam pomoći da identificirate ili ispravite problem.\n"

